sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>MyProjectsPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewMyProjectsBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewMyProjectsController
  participant InteriorDesignProject as «entity»<br/>InteriorDesignProject
  participant ProjectView as «entity»<br/>ProjectView
  participant Favourite as «entity»<br/>Favourite
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: list my IDPs with views and shortlists
  UI->>B: GET /api/designer/projects (JWT)
  B->>C: list(Integer designerId, Pageable pageable)
  C->>InteriorDesignProject: findOwnedByDesigner()
  InteriorDesignProject->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>InteriorDesignProject: rows
  InteriorDesignProject-->>C: result
  C->>ProjectView: countsForProjects()
  ProjectView->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectView: rows
  ProjectView-->>C: result
  C->>Favourite: shortlistCounts()
  Favourite->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Favourite: rows
  Favourite-->>C: result
  C-->>B: PageResponse<DesignerProjectSummary>
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result